    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Holding jump lets you glide smoothly across gaps while the capsule stays
        firmly locked to the platform. Jumping consumes energy  <sprite=21> \u2014
        the longer you hold, the more you spend. Developed by the Aerodynamics Research
        Institute on an experimental jetpack prototype."
