    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Sprinting, like every other module, consumes energy   <sprite=21> \u2014
        no surprise there. Rumour has it this booster once belonged to a company
        famous for the fastest, most reliable deliveries. After the world collapsed,
        couriers kept that tradition, carrying cargo just as fast and just as safely."
