    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Dashing also burns through your energy reserves   <sprite=21> \u2014
        better get used to it. No one really knows who designed the dash engine or
        what it was meant for. What we do know is that during a dash, the sprout
        capsule is firmly locked to the platform."
