      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Terrain scans show where and how it\u2019s safest to cross. Icons mark
        safe routes and danger zones. Few people know the prototype is built on a
        LiDAR i17 Pro Max, codename XZ-3000."
