    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The magnetic platform locks objects in place and keeps them from moving.
        Using it consumes energy <sprite=21> . Back in the day these magnets were
        used on junkyards to sort scrap metal; now they\u2019re used to save the
        world. The world is unpredictable."
